    "solution": "public static int[] twoSum(int[] nums, int target) {\n    Map<Integer, Integer> map = new HashMap<>();\n    for (int i = 0; i < nums.length; i++) {\n        int comp = target - nums[i];\n        if (map.containsKey(comp)) return new int[]{map.get(comp), i};\n        map.put(nums[i], i);\n    }\n    return new int[]{};\n}",
